  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Enrichment Solution for Seawater Medium Recipe">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Directions
For 2 L Total

To approximately 1 L of dH2O, add each of the components in the order specified (except vitamins) while stirring continuously.
Adjust the pH to 7.8.
Bring the total volume to 2 Liters with dH2O.




#
Component
Amount
Stock Solution Concentration
Final Concentration


1
NaNO3(CAS: 7631-99-4)
4.7 g/2 L

27.65 mM


2
Na2glycerophosphate•5H2O(CAS: 13408-09-8)
0.98 g/2 L

1.6 mM


3
ES Fe Solution
325 mL/2 L




4
P-II Metal Solution
325 mL/2 L




5
HEPES buffer(CAS: 7365-45-9)
6.5 g/2 L

14 mM


6
Vitamin B12
3 mL/2 L




7
Biotin Vitamin Solution
3 mL/2 L




8
Thiamine Vitamin Solution
3 mL/2 L





Note: Final concentration listed is for the stock solution.
