                                        <div class="row">
                                            <h1 style="text-align:center;">Enrichment Solution for Seawater Medium Recipe</h1>
                                        </div>
                                    

                                    <div class="row description card-base card-1" style="padding:1em;" id="recipe" itemprop="description">
                                        
                                        <h4 class="details-heading">Directions</h4>
<h4>For 2 L Total</h4>
<ol>
<li>To approximately 1 L of dH<sub>2</sub>O, add each of the components in the order specified (except vitamins) while stirring continuously.</li>
<li>Adjust the pH to 7.8.</li>
<li>Bring the total volume to 2 Liters with dH<sub>2</sub>O.</li>
</ol>
<table id="responsive-table" class="large-only stacktable">
<tbody>
<tr align="center">
<th id="bold">#</th>
<th id="bold">Component</th>
<th id="bold">Amount</th>
<th id="bold">Stock Solution Concentration</th>
<th id="bold">Final Concentration</th>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<td>1</td>
<td>NaNO<sub>3</sub><br>(CAS: 7631-99-4)</td>
<td>4.7 g/2 L</td>
<td></td>
<td>27.65 mM</td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<td>2</td>
<td>Na<sub>2</sub>glycerophosphate<b>•</b>5H<sub>2</sub>O<br>(CAS: 13408-09-8)</td>
<td>0.98 g/2 L</td>
<td></td>
<td>1.6 mM</td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<td>3</td>
<td><a href="/products/ES-Fe-solution">ES Fe Solution</a></td>
<td>325 mL/2 L</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<td>4</td>
<td><a href="/products/p-ii-metal-solution">P-II Metal Solution</a></td>
<td>325 mL/2 L</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<td>5</td>
<td>HEPES buffer<br>(CAS: 7365-45-9)</td>
<td>6.5 g/2 L</td>
<td></td>
<td>14 mM</td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<td>6</td>
<td><a href="/products/vitamin-b-12">Vitamin B<sub>12</sub></a></td>
<td>3 mL/2 L</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<td>7</td>
<td><a href="/products/biotin-vitamin-solution">Biotin Vitamin Solution</a></td>
<td>3 mL/2 L</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr align="center">
<td>8</td>
<td><a href="/products/thiamine-vitamin-solution">Thiamine Vitamin Solution</a></td>
<td>3 mL/2 L</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h4 class="details-heading">Note: Final concentration listed is for the stock solution.</h4>
<p><script src="//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0750/1627/t/19/assets/stacktable.js?4480335158902071696"></script> <script>// <![CDATA[
$('table#responsive-table').stacktable();
